0,Aymara - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aymara,"Corazón Aymara (English: Aymara Heart), 1925 Bolivian silent feature film directed by Pedro Sambarino. Grupo Aymara, Bolivian folk troupe of traditional music of pre-Hispanic and contemporary music of the Andes.","Aymara, Central",Aymaran
1,Aymara language - Wikipedia,https://adjkjc.github.io/en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aymara_language.html,"Aymara (IPA: [ajˈma.ɾa] ( About this sound listen); also Aymar aru) is an Aymaran language spoken by the Aymara people of the Andes. It is one of only a handful of Native American languages with over one million speakers.[4][5] Aymara, along with Spanish, is an official language of Bolivia.","Aymara, Central",Aymaran
