7,"Aymara, Central",https://accentnetwork.com/aymara-central/,"Aymaran. Aymara, Central, Bolivia.Central Aymara, a language of the Aymaran family, is indigenous to the Andean region. It is primarily spoken in Bolivia, Peru, and Chile, with about 2 million speakers.","Aymara, Central",Aymaran
